# Segmented ALIKED operators

ALIKED: Xiaoming Zhao, Xingming Wu, Weihai Chen, Peter C. Y. Chen, Qingsong Xu and Zhengguo Li (2023). Original code and checkpoints: https://github.com/Shiaoming/ALIKED/tree/683d7c65197395c0b3f01ebe76e1084a27e73a65.

The N16 and N16-rot graphs partition the original checkpoint operators for bounded browser execution. Learned tensor payloads retain their original values. The accompanying manifests identify the original checkpoints and each converted graph. The original BSD 3-Clause licence is retained in LICENSE-ALIKED-BSD-3-Clause.txt. This adaptation is not endorsed by the original authors.
